  "label": "provocative glamour aesthetic mapped to Auburn University fan",
  "description": "The text 'it's an auburn fan' explicitly maps the visual presentation of the woman — her glamorous, provocative styling (blonde curls, red lipstick, red dress) — onto the identity of an Auburn University fan. This creates an analogical mapping where the visual aesthetic is equated with the fan group, reducing the fan's identity to a superficial or objectified image. The top text 'whatever this is..' sets up the rhetorical question, implying the viewer should recognize the visual as something associated with Auburn fans, thus completing the mapping.",
